+ * the array should not be used after this call (except to free it).
+ *
+ * Failure means the collection is in an invalid state.
+ *
+ * numInstances = 0 means the array is NULL-terminated
+ */
+NSS_EXTERN PRStatus
+nssPKIObjectCollection_AddInstances
