+ ************************************************************************/
+
+/*
+ * NSS_CMSUtil_EncryptSymKey_RSA - wrap a symmetric key with RSA
+ *
+ * this function takes a symmetric key and encrypts it using an RSA public key
+ * according to PKCS#1 and RFC2633 (S/MIME)
