+
+@
+@ File Name:  omxSP_FFTInv_CToC_SC16_Sfs_s.s
+@ OpenMAX DL: v1.0.2
+@ Last Modified Revision:   6729
+@ Last Modified Date:       Tue, 17 Jul 2007
+@
